{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"magic_alchemy","name_zh":"炼金术","name_en":"Alchemy","aliases":["炼金术","Alchemy"],"category":"technology","scope":"cross_regional","regions":[],"summary":"炼金术是一门自古传承、许多秘密已经失落的技艺，现有研究会结合古代技术与当世成果继续演进。炼金师可借合成台开展实验和药剂试制，并形成不同研究方向；从业者明确将其与机械技术区分，也否认它是万能法术。合成台分布于提瓦特多地，而蒙德已有公开炼金铺、教学活动及正式研究职务。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"magic_alchemy_fact_01","text":"炼金术是一门从古代传承下来的技艺；其许多秘密已经失落，当代常见技术只保留了有限的部分。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"古代至当代","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_magic_alchemy_04","fandom_sup_magic_alchemy_05"]},{"fact_id":"magic_alchemy_fact_02","text":"蒂玛乌斯称，当代对炼金术的理解仍然很少，其机制在他看来充满魔法性与神秘性，并不同于人们用于理解物理世界的通常原理。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"当代","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_magic_alchemy_04"]},{"fact_id":"magic_alchemy_fact_03","text":"蒂玛乌斯认为，炼金术会在发掘古代技术的同时吸收当世研究成果，并由此不断演化和进步。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"当代","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_magic_alchemy_03"]},{"fact_id":"magic_alchemy_fact_04","text":"砂糖说明，炼金术士通常各有自己的研究课题与方向；她还明确区分炼金术与机械技术，并否认炼金术是能够实现一切目标的万能法术。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"当代","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_magic_alchemy_04"]},{"fact_id":"magic_alchemy_fact_05","text":"合成台是用于施行炼金术的设施，并分布于提瓦特多地。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当代","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_magic_alchemy_03","bwiki_magic_alchemy"]},{"fact_id":"magic_alchemy_fact_06","text":"蒙德的炼金活动具有公开服务、教学和正式研究职务：城内设有炼金铺，蒂玛乌斯平时会教授他人炼金术，阿贝多担任西风骑士团首席炼金术士并指导砂糖与蒂玛乌斯。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当代","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_magic_alchemy_01","fandom_sup_magic_alchemy_05"]},{"fact_id":"magic_alchemy_fact_07","text":"炼金研究可以包含借助合成台进行的药剂试制；蒂玛乌斯曾将此类试制作为具体研究项目。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当代","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_magic_alchemy_03"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"阿贝多来到蒙德之前","order_hint":10,"events":["蒙德普通市民曾将当时常见的炼金术理解为只能拼补破损杂物的有限技巧，并一度认为炼金术是没有多少用处的学科。"],"current_status":"这是蒙德过去的公众印象，不代表炼金术的实际能力。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_magic_alchemy_05","local_sup_magic_alchemy_04"]},{"period":"阿贝多来到蒙德之后","order_hint":20,"events":["阿贝多在蒙德展示了远超当地既有认识的炼金术能力，使此前将炼金术视为无用或仅能修补杂物的理解发生变化。"],"current_status":"蒙德现有首席炼金术士、助手、学生及公开教学活动，但普通市民目前具体理解到何种程度仍未被完整界定。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_magic_alchemy_05","local_sup_magic_alchemy_01","local_sup_magic_alchemy_04"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"蒙德公众知道炼金术这一学科的存在，并可通过炼金铺、教学和合成台接触其基础实践；深层机制、失传知识及专业研究方向主要由炼金术士和相关研究者掌握。合成台虽分布于提瓦特多地，但现有证据不足以确定其他地区普通公众的理解程度。","likely_known_by":["蒙德的炼金术士、助手与学生","西风骑士团的相关研究人员","接触蒙德炼金铺或合成台的人"],"unlikely_known_by":["未接受炼金训练的普通人对其深层机制、失传知识和专业研究分支"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["阿贝多来到蒙德前，当地曾有炼金术没有多少用处、只能进行简单修补的认识。","存在将炼金术视为万能法术的误解；砂糖明确表示炼金术有能力边界，也不能使物质永驻。"]},"activation_keys":["炼金术","Alchemy"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["玩家必须在合成台旁操作、冒险等阶解锁、界面标签、地图图标及版本更新记录。","材料品质合成比例、摩拉消耗、突破与天赋材料转换、药剂战斗增益、角色固有天赋概率、树脂、圣遗物还圣奥迹及相关奖励。","尘歌壶中的制作、摆放与玩家住宅操作。"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["「烟霰丹剂」起源于璃月并能使力量成倍增长的说法来自冷门书籍转述，未在证据包中得到验证。","所有形式的炼金术在任何情况下都必须依赖合成台，证据只足以确认合成台可用于施行炼金术。","炼金术在蒙德以外各地区的一般普及程度及普通公众认知边界。"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_magic_alchemy","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Alchemy","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Alchemy","language":"en","revision_id":"2116478","source_text_sha256":"5cac7601700bc22088383ed23de628d737a0b6a5a3983327342232743b5d9ac1"},{"source_id":"bwiki_magic_alchemy","provider":"bwiki","role":"cross_language_verification","title":"炼金","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/%E7%82%BC%E9%87%91","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"665166","source_text_sha256":"19ce005342cfdea754cdb1f7f7688a75675cbecfa0a5a237bbf752339236dbcd"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_magic_alchemy_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Alchemy","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Alchemy","language":"en","revision_id":"2116478","source_text_sha256":"3c5dae805cac0c6304ae4efae26c4066381c00ced982bad26a52eb45264b71f4"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_magic_alchemy_02","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Art of Khemia","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Art_of_Khemia","language":"en","revision_id":"2080489","source_text_sha256":"756e73c78cd0b8b140be20edd5da3ea05ea0dcd0726699e3cb0fac2bd1530987"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_magic_alchemy_03","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Crafting Bench","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Crafting_Bench","language":"en","revision_id":"2104223","source_text_sha256":"c01f4855feef370f5db57424bdbf461a2fcaf2a3cb06a51441ef80688b8c22e5"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_magic_alchemy_04","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Timaeus","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Timaeus","language":"en","revision_id":"1965541","source_text_sha256":"00bc2a0cdd075b99b5890382f02bb5df712d34dfb9fc4ea282f630796dc1c271"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_magic_alchemy_05","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Albedo/Profile","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Albedo/Profile","language":"en","revision_id":"2131075","source_text_sha256":"f689487325eaa7b8a5df498de46e5b8fe1a8631c3d155b1d250e74c3de51c322"},{"source_id":"local_sup_magic_alchemy_01","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"传闻中的炼金术士","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_11040.json#unit=1104002","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"a6559fea6db4e773c3525f110f60359f5cd6d17aadbbcb646d69562a002f1ecb"},{"source_id":"local_sup_magic_alchemy_03","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"丹剂与魔药","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_71659.json#unit=7165901","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"51c88dbdac3187b5bcfbdf9c051a037c8a8dc21c815a5be5921e6d93b742abf5"},{"source_id":"local_sup_magic_alchemy_04","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"冰雪往事","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_40025.json#unit=4002501","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"627b71cf21a4b6bddd1f1f90d4cec76f5a66b2369bd3d64a53f9ca87456cdbb3"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"112ff475f77712de96fbe8e89b7e6ba59cf0389057cc59cfba35a72ae1553530","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["蒂玛乌斯对炼金术机制及其与通常物理原理关系的描述属于角色观点，现有证据未提供独立的全知视角裁定。","炼金术通过结合古代技术与当世成果持续演进的概括来自蒂玛乌斯。","炼金术士通常各有研究课题、炼金术并非机械技术或万能法术的概括来自砂糖。"],"missing_evidence":["现有材料不足以界定蒙德以外各地区普通公众对炼金术的普及认知和理解深度；合成台跨地区存在只能证明设施分布。"],"needs_human_review":false}}